  Description: "COMPANION / MYTHIC / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEvery third basic attack may
    fire a coloured echo for 25% weapon damage. Shares this ally's 0.7s response
    cooldown. The echo cannot trigger itself.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nCompanions
    / Attack range: +6%\nCompanions / Attack speed: -2%\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4;
    merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA
    documentary keeper who found the official film had removed the people opening
    an exit. They smuggled out the discarded frames. They want to show the complete
    sequence in the square where the edited version played.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo
    additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed
    memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly
    stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: dream
    shop or special reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds: astral,
    resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
